ically in engineering. This sense, or any close to it, is markedly absent in Grimm's dictionary despite being contemperaneous. The closeness in sense and form could alternatively suggest a borrowing from English flange, flanch.",{"g":"m","decl":"||/e|es/s|e|e|en|e"}]],"senses":[[592204,"flansch","noun","flange (projecting edge at the end of component (esp. of metal) to fasten to or anchor with other parts, now especially of pipes)",0,"m"]],"inflections":[["flansch","flanschen","imperative,second-person,singular"]]},"gedauert":{"entries":[["gedauert",null,null,null]],"senses":[[106918,"gedauert","verb","past participle of dauern",0]],"inflections":[["gedauert","dauern","participle,past"]]},"gesintertem":{"entries":[["gesintertem",null,null,null]],"senses":[[231946,"gesintertem","adj","strong dative masculine/neuter singular of gesintert",0]],"inflections":[["gesintertem","gesintert","dative,masculine,singular,strong,without-article"]]},"halbmetallisch":{"entries":[["halbmetallisch",null,null,"Halbmetall + -isch"]],"senses":[[247849,"halbmetallisch","adj","semimetallic",0]]},"handelsgewinn":{"entries":[["handelsgewinn",null,"[ˈhandl̩sɡəˌvɪn]","Handel (“trade/commerce”) + -s- (“genitival interfix”) + Gewinn (“profit”)",{"g":"m","decl":"|||s|e|e|en|e"}]],"senses":[[719044,"handelsgewinn","noun","trading profit (the profit generated specifically from the buying and selling of goods or financial assets, typically calculated before operating expenses and taxes)",0,"m"]]},"hinterbänkler":{"entries":[["hinterbänkler",null,"[ˈhɪntɐˌbɛŋklɐ]","From Hinterbank (“backbench”) + -ler.",{"g":"m","decl":"|||s|||n|"}]],"senses":[[390186,"hinterbänkler","noun","backbencher",0,"m"]]},"kleiko":{"entries":[["kleiko",null,"/ˈklaɪ̯ko/","Blend of kleine (“small”) + Koalition (“coalition”), after Groko (“grand coalition”).",{"g":"f","decl":"||||s|s|s|s"}]],"senses":[[708002,"kleiko","noun","a coalition between SPD and Union in a situation where these are not the strongest two parliamentary gr